  dialogues:
  - text: May Lord protect you. What can i help you sir?
    npcId: sera
  - text: You ask sera about your mother.
    npcId: 
  - text: '*Sera hug you tight* So you do know about that night.'
    npcId: sera
  - text: Oh lord Arden, your name is Kaelen. That name is what your mother gave
      you.
    npcId: sera
  - text: That night, when your mother bring you to me, she got blood on her hand.
      Tell me your name and then disappear right after that.
    npcId: sera
  - text: I then rush to the guard and urge them to get to the estage. But then got
      a dangerous stare from the Guard Captain.
    npcId: sera
  - text: Even then he tell his men to get to there, i sense that keep you with me
      is too dangerous, then i bring the signet and letter of keep you in secret
      inside the tinbox, then put you infront of Vex office. I know him is the right
      person.
    npcId: sera
  - text: The next morning, I heard that all the Arden family was killed.
    npcId: sera
  - text: That all I know my dear.
    npcId: sera
  choices:
